#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Latar Belakang {#background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The **Qiskit AI-powered transpiler** introduces machine-learning-based "
"transpilation passes that can produce shorter, more hardware-efficient "
"circuits than traditional heuristic methods such as SABRE. Shorter circuits "
"accumulate less noise, which directly improves result quality on real "
"quantum hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Transpiler bertenaga AI Qiskit** memperkenalkan pass transpilasi berbasis "
"machine learning yang dapat menghasilkan Circuit yang lebih pendek dan lebih"
" efisien secara hardware dibandingkan metode heuristik tradisional seperti "
"SABRE. Circuit yang lebih pendek mengakumulasi lebih sedikit noise, yang "
"secara langsung meningkatkan kualitas hasil pada hardware kuantum nyata.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial we compare two transpilation strategies:\n"
msgstr "Dalam tutorial ini kita membandingkan dua strategi transpilasi:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Strategy | API |\n"
"|-|-|\n"
"| **Default** | `generate_preset_pass_manager(optimization_level=3, ...)` |\n"
"| **AI** | `generate_ai_pass_manager(optimization_level=1, ai_optimization_level=3, ...)` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Strategi | API |\n"
"|-|-|\n"
"| **Default** | `generate_preset_pass_manager(optimization_level=3, ...)` |\n"
"| **AI** | `generate_ai_pass_manager(optimization_level=1, ai_optimization_level=3, ...)` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We measure three metrics for each strategy: **two-qubit gate depth**, "
"**total gate count**, and **transpilation runtime**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita mengukur tiga metrik untuk setiap strategi: **two-qubit gate depth**, "
"**total jumlah Gate**, dan **waktu transpilasi**.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "AI-powered transpiler benchmarks {#ai-powered-transpiler-benchmarks}"
msgstr "Benchmark Transpiler bertenaga AI {#ai-powered-transpiler-benchmarks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In benchmarking tests, the AI-powered transpiler consistently produced "
"shallower, higher-quality circuits compared to the standard Qiskit "
"transpiler. For these tests, we used Qiskit's default pass manager strategy,"
" configured with "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)."
" While this default strategy is often effective, it can struggle with larger"
" or more complex circuits. By contrast, AI-powered passes achieved an "
"average 24% reduction in two-qubit gate counts and a 36% reduction in "
"circuit depth for large circuits (100+ qubits) when transpiling to the "
"heavy-hex topology of IBM Quantum&reg; hardware. For more information on "
"these benchmarks, refer to this "
"[blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-performance).\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam pengujian benchmark, Transpiler bertenaga AI secara konsisten "
"menghasilkan Circuit yang lebih dangkal dan berkualitas lebih tinggi "
"dibandingkan transpiler Qiskit standar. Untuk pengujian ini, kami "
"menggunakan strategi pass manager default Qiskit yang dikonfigurasi dengan "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)."
" Meskipun strategi default ini sering efektif, ia bisa kesulitan dengan "
"Circuit yang lebih besar atau lebih kompleks. Sebaliknya, pass bertenaga AI "
"mencapai rata-rata pengurangan 24% dalam jumlah Gate dua-Qubit dan "
"pengurangan 36% dalam kedalaman Circuit untuk Circuit besar (100+ qubit) "
"saat melakukan transpilasi ke topologi heavy-hex hardware IBM Quantum&reg;. "
"Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang benchmark ini, lihat "
"[blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-performance) ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![AI-powered transpiler benchmarks](/docs/images/tutorials/ai-transpiler-"
"introduction/ai-transpiler-benchmarks.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Benchmark Transpiler bertenaga AI](/docs/images/tutorials/ai-transpiler-"
"introduction/ai-transpiler-benchmarks.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial explores the key benefits of AI passes and how they compare to"
" traditional methods.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial ini mengeksplorasi manfaat utama AI passes dan bagaimana "
"perbandingannya dengan metode tradisional.\n"

